    "content": "**On Person Created** — Fires whenever a new person or contact is created in your Teamwork site. Use this to trigger onboarding workflows or sync contact data with other systems."
  }, {
    "heading": "triggers",
    "content": "**On Project Created** — Fires whenever a new project is created in your Teamwork site. Use this to automatically set up tasks, notify team members, or sync project data across platforms."
