    "heading": "get-a-businesspartner-by-emailaddress",
    "content": "**Get a Business Partner by Email Address** action retrieves the details of a business partner using their email address as the search criteria. It returns the matching record as a structured object."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-a-businesspartner-by-emailaddress",
    "content": "This action is commonly used to **lookup partner information**, **validate existing records**, **avoid duplicates**, or **fetch customer/vendor details** in workflows."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-a-businesspartner-by-emailaddress",
    "content": "If multiple records match the provided email address, the system may return the first matching result or a list of records based on configuration. If no match is found, the output will be empty or null.\n\\::"
  }, {
