    "heading": "get-a-item-by-itemcode",
    "content": "**Get an Item by ItemCode** action retrieves the details of an item using its unique ItemCode. It returns the matching item record as a structured object."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-a-item-by-itemcode",
    "content": "This action is commonly used to **lookup item information**, **validate product records**, **fetch inventory details**."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-a-item-by-itemcode",
    "content": "If the provided ItemCode does not exist, the output will be empty or null.\n\\::"
  }, {
