  }, {
    "heading": "create-a-new-item-create-a-new-item",
    "content": "**Create New Item** action creates a new item in the SAP with the specified details. It captures item information and stores it as a structured record for use in workflows and inventory processes."
  }, {
    "heading": "create-a-new-item-create-a-new-item",
    "content": "This action is commonly used to **add new products**, **manage inventory**."
  }, {
    "heading": "create-a-new-item-create-a-new-item",
    "content": "If ItemCode is not provided, SAP may not generate Item. Optional fields can be configured as needed without blocking item creation.\n\\::"
  }, {
    "heading": "select-the-credential-and-action-event-6",
    "content": "Click on the **Continue** button."
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Field"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Description"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Item Code"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Unique identifier for the item (e.g., \"DOC-910\")."
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Item Name"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Enter the name of the item (e.g., \"ThinkPad-V1.2.2\")."
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Optional Fields Remarks"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Additional notes or comments related to the item. (e.g., \"ThinkPad is a line of business-focused laptops developed by Lenovo, originally created by IBM.\")"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Item Prices"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Defines pricing details for the item across different price lists. (e.g., \"PriceList: 1 - 500 INR, PriceList: 2 - 550 INR\")"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Inventory Item"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Indicates whether the item is managed in inventory. (e.g., \"Yes or No\")"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "InventoryUOM"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Item's stock is tracked and managed in the inventory system (e.g., Nos, Kg, Liters)."
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Location"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Specifies the storage location of the item.(e.g., \"Warehouse-1\")"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Item Group Code"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Categorizes the item into a specific group. (e.g., \"100\")"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Additional Identifier"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Any extra reference ID for the item (e.g., \"ALT-56789\")."
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Purchase Item"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Marks the item as available for purchasing. (e.g., \"Yes or No\")"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Sales Item"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Marks the item as available for sales. (e.g., \"Yes or No\")"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-22",
    "content": "Ship Type"
  }, {
