    "content": "Click on the **Continue** button, then **Run** the node."
  }, {
    "heading": "cancel-a-sales-order",
    "content": "**Cancel Sales Order** action cancels an existing sales order in the SAP using the document entry (DocEntry). Once cancelled, the order is marked as inactive and cannot be processed further."
  }, {
    "heading": "cancel-a-sales-order",
    "content": "This action is commonly used to **void incorrect orders**, **handle order cancellations**, or **stop further processing of an order**."
  }, {
    "heading": "cancel-a-sales-order",
    "content": "Once a sales order is cancelled, it cannot be reactivated. Ensure the correct DocEntry is provided before performing this action.\n\\::"
  }, {
