    "heading": "configuration-fields-34",
    "content": "Enter the internal document entry number of the sales order to be cancelled. (e.g., \"11464\")"
  }, {
    "heading": "configuration-fields-34",
    "content": "Click on the **Continue** button, then **Run** the node."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-invoice-by-docentry",
    "content": "**Get Invoice by DocEntry** action retrieves invoice details using the internal document entry number (`DocEntry`). It returns the matching invoice record as a structured object."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-invoice-by-docentry",
    "content": "This action is commonly used to **lookup invoice details**, **validate financial records**, **track billing information**, or **fetch invoice data for further processing**."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-invoice-by-docentry",
    "content": "If the provided DocEntry does not exist, the output will be empty or null.\n\\::"
  }, {
    "heading": "select-the-credential-and-action-event-19",
