    "content": "Click on the **Continue** button, then **Run** the node."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-invoice-by-order-docentry",
    "content": "**Get Invoice by Order DocEntry** action retrieves invoice details associated with a specific sales order using the order's document entry number. It returns the related invoice record(s) as structured data."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-invoice-by-order-docentry",
    "content": "This action is commonly used to **track invoices generated from orders**, **validate billing against sales orders**, or **fetch related financial documents for processing**."
  }, {
    "heading": "get-invoice-by-order-docentry",
    "content": "If no invoices are linked to the provided order DocEntry, the output will be empty or null. In case of multiple invoices, the SAP may return one or a list based on configuration.\n\\::"
  }, {
